      ],
      "content": "TL 00 SE          ABBOTS LANGLEY       STATION ROAD                                        (West side)                                        King's Langley 3/77                                   Home Park                                        Lock House GV                                     II Lock cottage on the Grand Union Canal at Lock No.  70.  Early C19. Whitewashed brick.  Hipped slate roof.  2 storeys.  2 windows with a central entrance, sashes, ground floor 16 pane, first floor 8 pane, all. recessed and with cambered heads. Dentilled brick eaves. End stacks. Interior not inspected. See Home Park Lock, GRAND UNION CANAL. Listing NGR: TL0776302067"
    }
